.DS_Store
node_modules

# Local-only: optional dogfooding of skills into an agent read-path (e.g. .claude/skills).
# Canonical source is top-level skills/ — never commit a second copy.
# Ignore everything under .claude/ EXCEPT the shipped role subagents (Layer B model pinning).
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
# Project skills are committed (the daily routine needs them); links to the workflow skills stay local.
!.claude/skills/
.claude/skills/*
!.claude/skills/learning-daily/
!.claude/skills/events-refresh/
!.claude/skills/fashion-refresh/
!.claude/skills/psychology-refresh/
!.claude/skills/culture-refresh/
